      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Tāwhaki tenía un hermano, Karihi. Su padre, Hema, había muerto a manos de los ponaturi.",
          "en": "Tāwhaki had a brother, Karihi. Their father, Hema, had been killed by the ponaturi."
        },
        {
          "es": "Los ponaturi eran seres extraños del mar. Vivían bajo el agua de día y salían a tierra de noche.",
          "en": "The ponaturi were strange beings of the sea. They lived under the water by day, and came ashore at night."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y la luz del sol era mortal para ellos.",
          "en": "And sunlight was deadly to them."
        },
        {
          "es": "También se habían llevado a su madre, Urutonga, para que cuidara la puerta de su casa.",
          "en": "They had also taken their mother, Urutonga, to keep the door of their house."
        }
      ],
