      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Llevaron a su madre de vuelta a casa. Y la fama de Tāwhaki llegó hasta el cielo.",
          "en": "They took their mother home. And Tāwhaki's fame reached the sky."
        },
        {
          "es": "En el cielo vivía Tangotango, una mujer celestial. Grey dice que también la llamaban Hāpai.",
          "en": "In the sky lived Tangotango, a woman of the heavens. Grey says she was also called Hāpai."
        },
        {
          "es": "Ella bajaba de noche a visitarlo. Al principio, él creyó que era una mujer de este mundo.",
          "en": "She came down at night to visit him. At first, he thought she was a woman of this world."
        },
        {
          "es": "Al fin le mostró quién era, y se quedó como su esposa.",
          "en": "At last she showed him who she was, and stayed as his wife."
        },
        {
          "es": "Y tuvieron una hijita.",
          "en": "And they had a little daughter."
        }
      ],
