      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Ella les mostró las enredaderas, y les dio la misma advertencia.",
          "en": "She showed them the vines, and gave them the same warning."
        },
        {
          "es": "Karihi saltó primero. Pero se agarró de una enredadera suelta.",
          "en": "Karihi jumped first. But he grabbed a loose vine."
        },
        {
          "es": "El viento lo atrapó y lo balanceó de un lado al otro del cielo.",
          "en": "The wind caught him, and swung him from one side of the sky to the other."
        },
        {
          "es": "«¡Suéltate, hermano!», gritó Tāwhaki. Karihi se soltó, y cayó de vuelta a la tierra, a salvo.",
          "en": "'Let go, my brother!' shouted Tāwhaki. Karihi let go, and fell back to the earth, safe."
        },
        {
          "es": "En la versión de Grey, Karihi volvió a casa. En otras, no sobrevive a la caída.",
          "en": "In Grey's version, Karihi went home to care for the families. In some others, he does not survive the fall."
        }
