      "frases": [
        {
          "es": "Otras tribus cuentan otra subida al cielo, por las canastas del saber. Unos dicen que la hizo Tāne; otros, Tāwhaki.",
          "en": "Other tribes tell of another climb to the sky, for the baskets of knowledge. Some say Tāne made it; others, Tāwhaki."
        },
        {
          "es": "¿Tú subirías hasta el cielo para reparar unas palabras descuidadas? Cuéntanos en los comentarios.",
          "en": "Would you climb to the sky to make up for a few careless words? Tell us in the comments."
        },
        {
          "es": "La próxima vez, un joven necesita una canoa, y el bosque entero se le pone en contra. Es La canoa de Rātā.",
          "en": "Next time, a young man needs a canoe, and the whole forest stands against him. It is Rātā's Canoe."
        }
